{
  "_readme": "Manifest consumed by `sta demo`. Each clip ships its video and its detections, so the demo runs with no model, no GPU and no network.",
  "source": {
    "study": "Broiler activity on a non-perforated grooved floor, Texas A&M University Poultry Science Center, 2025",
