    "camera": "Intel RealSense D415, RGB stream, 848 x 480 at 5 fps, 2.5 m above the floor, each camera covering two pens",
    "detector": "YOLO11x fine tuned on 720 overhead frames of the same house",
    "tracker": "ByteTrack, run per pen, match 0.70 / new 0.35 / buffer 60 at 5 fps",
    "selection": "the four annotated clips with the lowest human audited detector miss rate, all at or below 0.062 percent, each holding at least 15 active individual-frames so there is something to annotate",
